    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On March 9, 2022, the Company granted 4,500 RSU&rsquo;s to Directors that vest immediately. On the date of granting, the fair value and stock price was $103.00/share.</FONT></TD></TR>
