    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On March 9, 2022, the Company granted 18,000 RSU&rsquo;s to a Director that vest quarterly over 12 periods with the first vesting of 1,500 RSU&rsquo;s occurring on the date of the granted and another 1,500 vest every three months until all of the granted RSU&rsquo;s have vested. On the date of granting, the fair value and the stock price was $103.00/share.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
