    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On April 13, 2022, the Company granted 2,400 RSU&rsquo;s to consultants that vest immediately. On the date of granting, the fair value and the stock price was $110.00/share.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
