  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&#9679;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On April 13, 2022, the Company granted 5,850 RSU&rsquo;s to employees of the Company that vest quarterly over 12 periods with the first vesting of 488 RSU&rsquo;s occurring on the date of the granted and another 488 RSU&rsquo;s vest every three months until all of the granted RSU&rsquo;s have vested. On the date of granting, the fair value and the stock price was $110.00/share.</FONT></TD></TR>
